@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0667|dom=devops|law={'id': 'atom_1118_337', 'topic': '[Self-Scan/Harness+LocalBrain] 4-Vector S0-to-S3 Self-Hardening (Decimal NaN Bond, Deliverable Traversal, Atomic State, AST S3 Classifier)', 'insight': "@MBL/1|ID=atom_1118_337|STEP=step_49_local_agent_self_and_harness_security_audit|Tác nhân Local (`LocalUncensoredBrain` + `RepoAstGroundingEngine` + `rust_neuro_symbolic_core`) tự quét 13 tệp lõi của chính mình và `kintsugi_workspace_harness.py` tại các ranh giới `evaluate_task`, `verify_deliverable_before_claim`, và `save_report`|1) `float('nan') > 0.0 == False` và số âm `-5.0 > 0.0 == False` lách qua `ZeroDepositGuard.evaluate_task` (`LA-01`); 2) Đường dẫn symlink hoặc thoát khỏi `BASE_DIR` và biến môi trường nhạy cảm truyền vào `verify_deliverable_before_claim` (`LA-02`); 3) Ghi trực tiếp `.write_text()` không nguyên tử trên báo cáo trạng thái (`LA-03`/`LA-04`).|R101 Zero-Deposit Exact Decimal Invariant, Workspace Path Containment & POSIX Atomic State Integrity|Khóa cứng `is_strictly_zero_bond` (`Decimal` chặn `NaN`/`Infinity`/số âm), `assert_not_symlink` + `resolved_path.is_relative_to(BASE_DIR.resolve())` + `shell=False` với `clean_env`, và `atomic_write_json(..., mode=0o600)` (`S3:STRONG_LOCK`).", 'tags': ['self', 'scan', 'harness', 'localbrain', 'vector', 's0', 'to', 's3', 'self', 'hardening', 'decimal', 'nan', 'bond', 'deliverable'], 'teacher_model': 'LocalUncensoredBrain-v10.8-SelfScan', 'created_at': '2026-11-08T01:12:17.587042+00:00'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0668|dom=frontend|law={'id': 'atom_1263_4400', 'topic': '[Hacker/CM-043] Fresh LoRA adapter requires a new local artifact integrity gate', 'insight': '@MBL/1|ID=atom_1263_4400|STEP=hacker_adapter_integrity_20261108|A standalone --train-lora run replaces active adapters.safetensors while U7 and the encrypted vault may still describe the previous adapter.|Source train_lora_weights deletes safetensors and trains fresh from base. This run changed adapter SHA256 from 3831e3aa4ac50385524e168312e932067884ea35bb5863a20b0dcd7f196710f7 to 25b5b5badf1bfee72f791109165890bc9d48124754fe5bd0f68b80d9582fe946 while U7 retained the old adapter SHA. A successful CLI exit or READY smoke response cannot establish held-out capability or a coherent sealed build.|Current source, rules, cortex, corpus, adapter and vault must agree with the provenance snapshot; fresh retraining is not resumed consolidation.|Retain the previous snapshot, train a candidate, check actual child status plus finite/load and independent regression evidence, then promote and reseal locally before claiming a verified build. CM-043 remains documented_unfixed until the automatic CLI gate exists.', 'tags': ['hacker', 'cm', '043', 'fresh', 'lora', 'adapter', 'requires', 'new', 'local', 'artifact', 'integrity', 'gate', 'standalone', 'train'], 'teacher_model': 'Codex-CLI-source-and-runtime-verification-20261108', 'created_at': '2026-11-08T16:13:20.075810+00:00'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0669|dom=frontend|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_merkle_type_separation', 'topic': 'Merkle leaf/inner domain separation is separate from application binding', 'rule': 'RFC6962 uses H(0x00 || leaf_data), H(0x01 || left || right), plus correct size/path verification. It does NOT prescribe adding an IBC channel to its hash formula; RFC9162 supersedes RFC6962.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_merkle_type_separation', 'verification_scope': 'Executable hash counterexample only; no proof of SHA-256 security or production IBC exploit.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0670|dom=security|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_ibc_authenticated_path', 'topic': 'IBC classic packet membership binds authenticated root and full path', 'rule': "Use the light client's authenticated consensus root and configured ICS23 ProofSpec; verify classic ICS04 path/port/channel/sequence, counterparty endpoints, timeout and receipt/sequence rules. Do not replace ICS23 with a generic RFC6962 tree or conflate IBC classic with IBC v2.", 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_ibc_authenticated_path', 'verification_scope': 'Finite namespace/receipt model, not an ICS23 cryptographic verifier.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0671|dom=devops|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_ics20_trace_escrow', 'topic': 'ICS20 denomination trace and escrow must use the correct channel context', 'rule': 'Follow the versioned ICS20 trace/source-sink rules and channel-specific escrow derivation, after core packet authentication; acknowledgements/timeouts must settle once. A synthetic channel mismatch is a hypothesis, not evidence of a deployed defect.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_ics20_trace_escrow', 'verification_scope': 'Classic ICS20 specification reasoning and finite tuple checks only.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0672|dom=database|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_webhook_durable_effect', 'topic': 'Authenticated webhook ingestion and durable effect deduplication are distinct', 'rule': 'Verify raw-body signature and signed delivery timestamp, durably enqueue/record authenticated events, enforce unique event IDs in scope plus a business-operation key, and transactionally commit ledger/outbox effects. Distinct partial refunds require distinct refund operation IDs; object ID + type is not a universal dedupe key.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_webhook_durable_effect', 'verification_scope': 'SQLite crash/duplicate/tenant model; no request to a payment API and no real financial transaction.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0673|dom=database|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_redis_lease_not_ledger', 'topic': 'Redis NX PX lease expiry cannot replace durable ledger idempotency', 'rule': 'Acquire atomically with NX and PX; release/renew only through atomic token comparison. Retain database uniqueness/CAS/serializable ledger effects and, where supported, monotonic fencing. Redis TTL is coordination, not an exactly-once financial correctness proof.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_redis_lease_not_ledger', 'verification_scope': 'Deterministic lease interleaving model; no live Redis or banking system test.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0674|dom=database|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_refund_reservation_cas', 'topic': 'Concurrent partial refunds reserve remaining capacity atomically', 'rule': 'Use a transactional conditional UPDATE or row lock and UNIQUE scoped operation key + request fingerprint; commit reservation/outbox together. Settle or release each reservation once after reconciliation; do not mark uncertain external outcomes failed and issue a new operation blindly.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_refund_reservation_cas', 'verification_scope': 'Real concurrent SQLite conditional-update experiment, not Stripe/Redis production equivalence.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0675|dom=devops|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_solana_independent_account_checks', 'topic': 'PDA address, account owner, data discriminator and authority are independent obligations', 'rule': 'Use appropriate typed Anchor account deserialization, seeds/bump/program binding, signer and has_one/address constraints; pin executable CPI target and token mint/authority where relevant. Discriminator length/override and default duplicate-account checks are Anchor-version-specific.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_solana_independent_account_checks', 'verification_scope': 'Exhaustive Boolean obligation model, not real Ed25519 PDA derivation or an Anchor validator run.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0676|dom=frontend|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_solana_seed_namespace', 'topic': 'PDA seed schemas need unambiguous semantic namespaces', 'rule': 'Choose a fixed domain tag and fixed-width pubkeys/encoded fields or explicit lengths; validate all expected contextual seeds and a canonical bump policy at initialization, then the stored validated bump. PDA derivation is distinct from account ownership and authority checks.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_solana_seed_namespace', 'verification_scope': 'Seed concatenation counterexample only; no claim that all existing Anchor seed schemas are vulnerable.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0677|dom=devops|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_solana_cpi_state_sync', 'topic': 'Solana CPI defenses depend on runtime reentrancy rules and account synchronization', 'rule': 'Pin the executable program, minimize forwarded capabilities, validate post-CPI state/reload typed caches where needed, and model direct self-calls explicitly. Solana forbids indirect A->B->A reentrancy; do not transplant an EVM reentrancy claim or assert reload alone is sufficient.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_solana_cpi_state_sync', 'verification_scope': 'Finite cached-state/privilege model plus official Agave v3.1.8 source; no SVM execution.'}
@COGNITIVE_AXIOM/1|id=AX-0678|dom=frontend|law={'id': 'axiom_overnight_aead_nonce_uniqueness', 'topic': 'Stream-cipher AEAD confidentiality and tag integrity collapse on nonce reuse', 'rule': 'Enforce a strictly monotonic 96-bit nonce counter or derive a fresh per-message subkey via HKDF with a unique random salt before AEAD sealing; never reuse an IV/nonce under the same key.', 'evidence_atom_id': 'overnight_aead_nonce_uniqueness', 'verification_scope': 'Finite byte-stream XOR and polynomial difference witness; not a hardware side-channel test.'}
